dding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">편입생,복학생의 학교 적응을 돕기 위해 2026년도 1학기 또래상담-이음멘토링 프로그램을 운영하오니</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">1. 활동기간: </span>2026년 3월 ~ 6월</span></p><pre style