font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 700;\">5. 혜택</span></div></pre></pre></pre><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  - 멘토: </span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">BISKIT 마일리지(최대 325</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">점), 멘토장학금 지급(총 50만원, 7월 일괄 지급 예정)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  - 멘티: </span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">BISKIT 마일리지(최대 325</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">점), 학교적응지원</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 1rem; text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">5. 신청 방법: </b></p><pre style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; overflow: auto; word-break: keep-all;\"><pre style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; overflow: auto; word-break: keep-all;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); text-wrap-mode: wrap; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  - 멘토: 붙임파일(</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">멘</span><span style=